  "naming_justifications": "social is a BNF v4.1 kebab-case microservice slug; generated names follow oya-community-social-<bounded-context>-<layer>, with layer rest from ADR-0105's 13-layer enum. Connect-social domain foundation crate is present as the spec-bound platform social domain surface; oya-community-social-* runtime slices remain planned adapter/kernel surfaces. Post-composition api/usecase foundation crates are present to bridge the social domain model toward the standalone social microservice contract surface. Post-composition REST boundary crate is framework-free and OpenAPI-route-aligned until runtime Hyper bindings land.",
